带状态的概念性函数对象：
```cpp
class Sum {
    int total = 0;
public:
    int operator()(int value) {
        total += value;
        return total;
    }
};
```

带可配置行为的概念性函数对象：
```cpp
class GreaterThan {
    int threshold;
public:
    explicit GreaterThan(int t) : threshold(t) {}
    bool operator()(int value) const {
        return value > threshold;
    }
};
```
